# L §6.1: "each side names a kind, a thing (a keyed place at its keys included), a row ... or a movement ...; any other
# pair is refused (LOAD-SAME)". A keyed place named without its keys is a family of places, no thing.
=== options pin=bytes
=== joint.tally
model family
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-05
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  use a = "ana.tally" sha256 "432b7b5dd0fd5f137444cfc19bed9e25e0dc859eaf9235087972744d12a85c21"
  use b = "ana2.tally" sha256 "432b7b5dd0fd5f137444cfc19bed9e25e0dc859eaf9235087972744d12a85c21"
  same a.sav = b.sav

ask n: count(p in accounts on 2026-12-31)
=== ana.tally
model ana
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-05
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind persons
place sav[p in persons]: accounts PLN lives 2019-01-01..
=== ana2.tally
model ana
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-05
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind persons
place sav[p in persons]: accounts PLN lives 2019-01-01..
=== expect
refused: LOAD-SAME same names a.sav, a keyed place, without its keys ...
